<title>ITALY: CYCLING-ITALY'S GUALDI WINS 17TH GIRO STAGE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-ITALY'S GUALDI WINS 17TH GIRO STAGE.</headline>
<dateline>VERONA, Italy 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mirko Gualdi of Italy won the 200-km 17th stage of the Giro d'Italia cycle race on Tuesday, according to provisional results.  </p>
<p>Italian Alessandro Pozzi was second and Jose Gonzalez of Colombia third, according to the provisional results.</p>
<p>Ivan Gotti of Italy retained the overall lead.</p>
